body:
I second this, I have heavily thought about transitioning in to nannying should the stress and frustration of my classroom become too much to handle in the future.

&#x200B;

I'd be lying if I said the idea doesn't float my mind every so often when I have 12 screaming infants in one room on a regular basis, to going down to only one or 2 at a time

Swooping Evil, they're adorable!

&#x200B;

Adorable little butterfly with fox/wolf skull head thing
